ris positions herself as a crucial part  of the flash's world  indeed she's been more than explicit  about the importance of the non-powered  team  in barry's life you're human  and we have a purpose too we remind  superheroes what they're fighting for  over time she grows close to barry and  the pair eventually marry  she has a child with barry named nora  but in true flash fashion  the child turns out to be unstuck in  time and is subsequently raised by iris  entirely alone after barry winks out of  existence  iris then hides nora's speedster powers  by implanting a limiting chip in her  daughter and steering her away from  stories about her father  in time nora learns of her abilities and  grows resentful of iris  traveling back in time to join team  flash as an adult  and finally meeting her father for the  first time  over time nora west allen becomes  obsessed  with the super-powered serial killer  known as cicada  a villain that her late father never  caught when she travels back in time  she attempts to help her parents put a  stop to his crime spree  unfortunately mucking about in the time  stream alters the future so much  that nora herself ceases to exist before  she's erased from reality  nora is able to embrace iris and barry  one last time  the sudden loss of nora shakes iris  deeply but she doesn't have much time to  dwell on it  just one season later iris herself is  whisked out of the flash's universe  finding herself trapped in a dark  parallel universe  called the mirror verse while the flash  showrunners have revealed that iris will  return  from the mirror verse in season seven  she'll likely be deeply traumatized by  her time in that parallel universe  luckily if anything is clear about iris  west by now  it's that she always finds a way to  triumph over adversity  check out one of our newest videos right  here plus  even more looper videos about your  favorite movies comics and tv shows are  coming soon  subscribe to our youtube channel and hit  the bell so you don't miss  a single one  [Music]

